        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-24T16:20:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, Dawn can be built with `DAWN_USE_BUILT_DXC`, and then run with the flag to disable `use_dxc`, so this would fail the check. Try running Chrome with `--disable-dawn-features\u003duse_dxc` and it should fail. This is why we had the conditional logic before to set the adapter toggle\u0027s default based on the result of this runtime flag.",
      "parentUuid": "d024d158_05af352b",
      "revId": "f5c8223e93d3d1331a17bc53ec820fd523d03380",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
